<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Nov 15, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Nov 15   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 4,302    4,930 10,752</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     192	136    316</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 5,357    5,929 12,374</p>
<p>						   3HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,732    1,923   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     313	345   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,583    3,583   unq</p>
<p>Total					 5,628    5,851   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
